### Crear plato
POST http://localhost:3000/api/platos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Nuevo plato",
  "descripcion": "Prueba",
  "ingredientes": ["a","b"],
  "precio": 1000,
  "aptoCeliacos": true,
  "aptoVeganos": false,
  "aptoDiabeticos": true,
  "calorias": 200,
  "imagen": "https://example.com/x.jpg"
}

### Listar
GET http://localhost:3000/api/platos

### Obtener por id (reemplazar ID)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/platos/ID

### Modificar
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/platos/ID
Content-Type: application/json

{ "precio": 1100 }

### Baja
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/platos/ID
